{"id":"input-f25be87dc037","steamAppId":"467370","name":"Escape This","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467370/portrait.png","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/467370/","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"platforms":["windows","mac"],"controllerSupport":"unknown","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":0.06,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"60 MB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","steamTags":["Precision Platformer","Perma Death","Difficult","Puzzle Platformer","Moddable","Puzzle","Level Editor","Arcade","3D Platformer","Top-Down","3D","Family Friendly","Singleplayer","Casual","Action","Strategy","Shooter","Indie","Dating Sim"],"sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"Escape This is a precision 3d platformer. Complete each of the random levels without touching any of the red blocks. It is possible to make your own levels","developers":["Four Winged Studio"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:19:38.108379+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"Escape This is a precision 3d platformer. Complete each of the random levels without touching any of the red blocks. It is possible to make your own levels","detailedDescription":"Escape This\n is a casual puzzle game where the main objective is for the player to complete the given stage. \nEach stage is selected at random.\n\nAll maps can be edited and you are also able to create your own unique maps and share them with the rest of the community.\n\nCan you escape?"},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Trốn thoát là một nền tảng chính xác 3D. Hoàn thành mỗi cấp độ ngẫu nhiên mà không chạm vào bất kỳ khối nào của các khối đỏ. Nó có thể tự tạo ra cấp bậc của riêng bạn","detailedDescription":"Thoát khỏi đây là một trò chơi giải đố ngẫu nhiên nơi